	x_* are fields I added.

	x_acm_id records the citation ID assigned by ACM.  I don't like theirs since
	they're just serial numbers, but it may be useful to keep them handy in case
	I need them later.

	x_interest explains why I thought this article was interesting in the first
	place.

	x_cited_by describes the citation tree.

	x_quality is how good I think it is:  worst, bad, fair, good, best
}

